<title>USA: Burlington Northern files $550 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>Burlington Northern files $550 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Northern Santa Fe Corp filed Tuesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $550 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, which may include repaying outstanding debt, capital expenditures and stock repurchases.</p>
<p>The company did not name underwriters in the registration statement.</p>
</text>
